{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1794494573,"nonce":"6hTeyuRe5LRlnww0bSgpKRIkyRI=","message":"Landed on `roadmap-3bc0ebb-integration` (c1e3a07..0c04401).\n\n**Changes**\n- src/fx.rs: new. `fetch_rate` (wiremock-tested), `pick_rate`/`RatePick`, `validate_rate`/`validate_fx`. Rates must be finite and within 1.0..=1000.0 UYU/USD.\n- src/pipeline.rs: new. `ItemInput`, `CompareInput`, `ComparisonResult`, `PipelineError`, `PipelineEvent`, `run_comparison` (mpsc-backed stream) and 13 tests using FakeScraper/FakeLlm.\n- src/lib.rs: exports `fx` and `pipeline`.\n- Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock: added `tokio-stream`.\n\n**Gates:** fmt ok · clippy ok · tests ok (101 passed) · scraper-tests n/a\n**Review:** 2 findings — 1 auto, 0 by hand, 1 deferred\n- `Waiting` notice fires after the limiter has already slept (`report(waited)` runs after `acquire()` in src/llm/gemini.rs:90-93), so a progress UI shows nothing during the stall. Comes from L4 (d51679c). Fix: have `RateLimiter::acquire` report the remaining wait before sleeping; that changes its return contract, which the limiter tests assert on.\n\n**Decisions**\n- FxRate validation closed in the FX layer: fetched rates are validated; `pick_rate` skips an invalid manual or cached rate; `run_comparison` validates `input.fx` first and emits `Finished(Err(PipelineError::InvalidFx))` before any scrape or LLM call.\n- Added `PipelineError::InvalidFx(String)`, not in the plan's interface.\n- `pick_rate` does not reuse a cached rate with `manual: true`.\n- Prefilled items emit no `Scraped` event. Unsupported URLs count as scrape failures.\n- The stream spawns its work on first poll. Dropping the stream cancels the run and aborts in-flight tasks.\n- `ComparisonResult` indexing: only `excluded` uses `CompareInput::items` indices; everything else is indexed by position among surviving products.\n- `ScrapeError` has no serde derives, so `ComparisonResult` is not serde-serializable. L8's `ComparisonRecord` will need that added.","files":null}]}